{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26525227713779328", "organization": {"id": "956449780895565", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "26525227713779328"}]}, "id": "1604028487595793"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "26525227713779328", "release_date": 1776790920, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27328925956742829"}, "id": "789419050893968"}]}}, "binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26525227713779328", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27328925956742829"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "id": "27285003827801709", "version": "1.0.7", "version_code": 7, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1779843923, "id": "27286061611029264", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v2", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 1, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "26852273147741448"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "26525227713779328"}, "id": "26852273147741448", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": null, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622919_1442534707124789_5971653655347644370_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j87X_pphqyUQ7kNvwFAx6dh&_nc_oc=Ado4r2tQN4GM-lx_9AfCLvaUxu7GeEgGHtcZnjQ-4Rna3c0tf6-UxHAvnZ5ekzscNf0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7uIsFtbTygi2UrKuD_UxNj0AEXzi-jKeGgMyLZN02p8Q&oe=6A204EB5"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Somos Huella", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Media", "id": "434961926215971"}], "release_date": 1776790920, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "26525227797112653", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "26525227713779328", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "795888816909742"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1641332833680546", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Somos Huella", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Somos Huella VR te invita a un viaje espiritual y tecnol\u00f3gico sin precedentes. Sum\u00e9rgete en el hist\u00f3rico \"Camino de Juan Diego\" y revive las apariciones de la Virgen de Guadalupe a trav\u00e9s de una experiencia cinematogr\u00e1fica inmersiva en realidad virtual 360\u00b0.\n\nEsta aplicaci\u00f3n ha sido dise\u00f1ada con un enfoque especial en la accesibilidad, teniendo como p\u00fablico principal a los adultos mayores. Nuestro objetivo es que la tecnolog\u00eda no sea una barrera, sino un puente hacia la fe. Por ello, ofrecemos una experiencia simple, intuitiva desde el primer uso y con m\u00ednima interacci\u00f3n manual.\n\nCaracter\u00edsticas de la experiencia:\n\nInmersi\u00f3n Profunda: Disfruta de una producci\u00f3n de video 360\u00b0 de la m\u00e1s alta calidad con una duraci\u00f3n aproximada de 40 minutos.\n\nCero Complicaciones: Reproducci\u00f3n autom\u00e1tica del video al iniciar la aplicaci\u00f3n. \u00a1Solo ponte las gafas y el viaje comenzar\u00e1!\n\nSensores Inteligentes: El sistema cuenta con pausa autom\u00e1tica al retirar el visor y reanudaci\u00f3n autom\u00e1tica al volver a colocarlo, permiti\u00e9ndote tomar descansos sin perder el hilo de la historia.\n\nAccesibilidad Integrada: Reproductor optimizado para video 360\u00b0 que incluye opciones de subt\u00edtulos activables y desactivables de manera sencilla.\n\nDise\u00f1o Limpio: Una interfaz m\u00ednima y clara, pensada para usuarios no t\u00e9cnicos y dise\u00f1ada para evitar distracciones.", "short_description": "Vive la historia de San Juan Diego y las apariciones de la Virgen de Guadalupe en una experiencia inmersiva y espiritual de realidad virtual en 360\u00b0"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverConLogoTemplateLandscape.png", "id": "2029559681327751", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619078_2029559684661084_3752516845270530209_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IBpaACqMYNEQ7kNvwFbjjho&_nc_oc=AdpGIA3Vbx_VhhUw49kxWdLZFAuXUfKViNgXbU9R4AWxbugc6tCOutCrVJPm3ZgApfc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4EhPq_-_aPcCgi6J-xtK87xJZfCdNDRaaIKAg4dIYRCg&oe=6A2042CC"}, {"file_name": "icono transparente.png", "id": "1466525468185772", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310720_1466525471519105_5421593714863712822_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TssNmP7x4SIQ7kNvwE58Tfm&_nc_oc=Adp9q4oU--BF3mHIuRkoWbOU5Wr6WFjeneEGFYzX6tH7W2UmZaIy9ikzqm82iS0Yp2k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6t-pP_N34y7OhOORq9dnwAbHg2XMmvb4sezEITcHM5HQ&oe=6A202E08"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare.png", "id": "1442534703791456", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622919_1442534707124789_5971653655347644370_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7